**Definition (`smashCurryEquiv`).** Currying against the smash product yields an order isomorphism between strict maps out of smash and strict maps into the strict function space.

*Proof.* The forward and reverse maps are smashCurryMap and smashUncurryMap; the inverse laws and relation preservation supply the isomorphism. ∎

